  "situation": {
    "en": "11 armed incidents were reported in Colombia in the past seven days, 38% more than the week before. Most were armed clashs (91%), followed by armed assaults (9%). The most reported locations over the past month were La Espriella, Espriella and El Tiempo. UCDP lists 9 active armed conflicts here, the oldest dating from 1964.",
    "nb": "11 væpnede hendelser ble meldt i Colombia de siste sju dagene, 38 prosent flere enn uken før. Flest gjaldt væpnet sammenstøt (91 prosent), deretter væpnet angrep (9 prosent). De mest omtalte stedene den siste måneden var La Espriella, Espriella og El Tiempo. UCDP fører 9 aktive væpnede konflikter her, den eldste fra 1964."
